WEBVTT

00:28:00.460 --> 00:28:02.406
Actually, she had one the day we spoke,

00:28:02.430 --> 00:28:04.621
with the receptionist
at Michigan Public Radio,

00:28:04.645 --> 00:28:06.741
where she was settling in
for our interview.

00:28:06.765 --> 00:28:11.343
JD: Yes, the wonderful
energy-creating thing she did

00:28:11.367 --> 00:28:15.516
is she could see that I was trying
to write down some notes

00:28:15.540 --> 00:28:18.186
and she just asked
me the simple question,

00:28:18.210 --> 00:28:20.968
"Do you need a pen? Can I get you a pen?"

00:28:20.992 --> 00:28:26.481
And I just felt seen, you know,
kind of understood.

00:28:26.505 --> 00:28:31.322
And again, in the wake of preparing
to sort of think about this interview